The demonstration pairs webcam-based driver monitoring with a CARLA 3D traffic scene. In the configured demonstration, sustained eye closure can trigger a warning and emergency sequence; the ego vehicle broadcasts a V2V message, relevant simulated vehicles react, and the ego vehicle attempts a controlled pull-over manoeuvre.

> **Demo note:** the displayed sequence demonstrates prototype behaviour in a configured simulation. It should not be interpreted as proof of real-world detection accuracy or certified vehicle safety.

